What ships
----------

The engine (engine/src), the root module (module/) and the app (app/) are original ResonanceFX
work, GPL-3.0-or-later. The DSP core in engine/src/core comes from Basilar, also by Xeloria and
also GPL-3.0-or-later. See docs/LICENSING.md for how the engine was written and what it does
and doesn't contain.

Third-party data
----------------

Head-related impulse responses in engine/src/core/src/data/KemarHrir.cpp are derived from the
complete MIT KEMAR set (710 positions, elevations -40 to +90 degrees; regenerate with
scripts/gen-kemar.py): W. G. Gardner and K. D. Martin, "HRTF Measurements of a KEMAR Dummy-Head
Microphone", MIT Media Lab Perceptual Computing Technical Report #280, 1994. Free to use with
this citation.

Headphone profiles in app/app/src/main/assets/autoeq/profiles.json are generated from the
AutoEq project (https://github.com/jaakkopasanen/AutoEq), Copyright (c) 2018-2022 Jaakko
Pasanen, MIT License (reproduced in app/app/src/main/assets/autoeq/LICENSE and shown in the
app under Settings > Open-source licenses). Measurements by their respective sources
(oratory1990, crinacle, Rtings and others) as credited in AutoEq.

The root module's installer conventions follow the Magisk module template (Zackptg5 and
contributors); module/META-INF/com/google/android/update-binary is an original minimal stub.

Android AIDL effect front-end
-----------------------------

engine/src/android/aidl/third_party/aosp contains code from the Android Open Source Project,
Copyright (C) 2022-2023 The Android Open Source Project, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0): EffectImpl, EffectContext,
EffectThread, the effect-impl headers, the FMQ headers and EventFlag/FmqInternal, adapted for
an out-of-tree NDK build. engine/src/android/aidl/generated contains headers generated from
the frozen android.hardware.audio.effect V3 API (also Apache-2.0). The modifications are
listed in engine/src/android/aidl/README.md; a copy of the licence is in
engine/src/android/aidl/third_party/aosp/LICENSE.

engine/src/android/aidl/prebuilt/arm64-v8a/android.hardware.audio.effect-V3-ndk.so is the
AOSP Android 16 frozen effect interface library (Apache-2.0), used only at link time and not
shipped in the module. Provenance and SHA-256 are recorded in
engine/src/android/aidl/prebuilt/README.md.

